  "description": "## 🏔️Stay Frosty🏔️\nEst. April 21st, 2024\n\nThank you for your interest in Stay Frosty. Please feel free to join our Discord - https://discord.gg/p3jzCnEswm (for raid/shooting star pings and giveaways.) or contact WastedPk at discord:cr4zh with any questions or inquiries.\n\n### Benefits\n* Daily Raids and Pool Buff.\n* Weekly Premium Membership giveaways. \n* Consumable Sponsorship (Frosty Shop)\n* Helpful community.\n* Guidance Scrolls Living Vending Machine (might not work sometimes)\n\n### Rules\n* Online Inactivity for 3 days period without notice will result in a kick.\n* Guild Activity (Raid/Contribution/Challenge) should be performed daily.\n* Former members may freely re-apply in the future.\n\n### RAID TIMES: \n* (1:45 PM GMT) - Energizing Pool Buff Activation.\n* (2:00 PM GMT) - Isle of Whispers Raid (Combat Lvl. 92).\n\n### Communications\n* Discord - https://discord.gg/p3jzCnEswm (for raid/shooting star pings and giveaways.)\n\nWe also have a 2nd guild Imperium of Man for low combat  level character that using the same discord server and everything else.",
